#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A Pinterest-style masonry theme for images and video. Statement hero with a featured-pin panel, self-hosted Garamond and Sabon typography, ten colour schemes with dark mode (all WCAG 2.2 AA), a full-screen lightbox, video pins, hidden tags, Markdown authoring, and a tabbed settings page. No jQuery, and the theme requests nothing from other servers unless you add a Pinterest Tag ID. Rebuilt from Genkisan's original iPin."
msgstr ""

